{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Rooster 是一款把日曆行程轉為自訂鬧鐘的工具，適合容易錯過重要會議、航班或預約的上班族與旅客。它可將行程設為響鬧，並在靜音模式下提醒，減少漏接重要事件。原價 US $0.99，現時<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-87.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>自訂鬧鐘精準提醒</h2>\n<p>Rooster 把日曆行程變成自訂鬧鐘，適合常忽略通知的上班族與旅客。連接日曆後，兩下即可將會議或航班設為響鬧，並可準時或提前 5、10、15 分鐘提示。程式另設獨立鬧鐘與彈性重複排程，經 iCloud 同步至各裝置，靜音模式下仍可運作。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-525-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-526-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-527-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-528-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-529-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Rooster – Calendar Alarms</li><li>應用類別：Productivity</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/rooster-calendar-alarms/id6758639891?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T07:00:21.882577+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":294,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T06:44:30+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T17:58:44.161069+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T06:58:22.959742+00:00","content_hash":"f5177c46a9cef39baf2baac860de0d8e8643640b9977f0d16c9e8a0591a876aa","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}